 ## Background
-TensoRF was introduced in the paper "TensoRF: Tensorial Radiance Fields" [S1, unofficial]. The method leverages tensor factorization to represent radiance fields, building on the principles of low-rank representations [11617-tensorial-and-low-rank-representations.md]. It addresses issues of overfitting and local minima common in gradient-based optimization of implicit fields by introducing specific regularization terms and a dynamic resolution update strategy [S1, unofficial].
